WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.631
This is Thero, a to-do app that keeps
every task in one clear order.

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.160
Designed.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.010
Built.

4
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.749
And shipped, start to finish.

5
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:12.821
With high, medium and low, tasks end up
tied.

6
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.524
Thero gives each one its own priority.

7
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.471
Something urgent came up?

8
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.828
Make it priority one, and everything else
moves down.

9
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.392
Finish it from the reminder.

10
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.811
Or the widget, without opening the app.

11
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.591
Build the design system first.

12
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.307
Keep data on the phone.

13
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:34.412
Design for every screen size.

14
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.711
Thero. One list, one clear order.

15
00:00:37.711 --> 00:00:39.000
[Instrumental music]
